{
  "title": "Submit a Press Release | Publish in 42 Minutes | PressCosmos",
  "description": "Submit a press release for editorial review and distribution across 2,400+ media destinations with AI answer-engine formatting. From $149 with no subscription.",
  "keywords": [
    "submit press release",
    "publish press release",
    "send a press release",
    "press release submission"
  ],
  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Submit a release</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"pill pill-live\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Median publish time: 42 minutes</p>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Submission</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">Submit your press release.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Ten minutes to submit, one hour to a decision, and a pickup report once it goes out. Your draft is saved as you type.</p>\n        \n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <ol class=\"stepper\" aria-label=\"Submission steps\">\n      <li class=\"is-active\">1. Choose a plan</li>\n      <li>2. Write your release</li>\n      <li>3. Set targeting</li>\n      <li>4. Review and pay</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <form class=\"panel panel-glass\" data-form=\"submission\" novalidate style=\"padding:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2.25rem);border-radius:var(--r-xl)\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">1. Choose a plan</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1);margin-top:.5rem\">You can change this later. Prices are per release unless stated otherwise.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid g-2 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"plan\">Distribution plan</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"plan\" name=\"plan\" required>\n            <option value=\"launch\">Launch — $149 per release</option><option value=\"amplify\" selected>Amplify — $349 per release</option><option value=\"newsmaker\">Newsmaker — $899 per release</option><option value=\"studio\">Studio — $1,990 per month</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"industry\">Primary industry</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"industry\" name=\"industry\" required>\n            <option value=\"technology\">Technology</option><option value=\"saas\">SaaS & B2B Software</option><option value=\"finance\">Finance & Banking</option><option value=\"crypto-web3\">Crypto & Web3</option><option value=\"healthcare\">Healthcare & Life Sciences</option><option value=\"real-estate\">Real Estate & Property</option><option value=\"education\">Education & EdTech</option><option value=\"travel-hospitality\">Travel & Hospitality</option><option value=\"automotive\">Automotive & Mobility</option><option value=\"entertainment\">Entertainment & Media</option><option value=\"legal-professional-services\">Legal & Professional Services</option><option value=\"ecommerce-retail\">E-commerce & Retail</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">2. Write your release</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1);margin-top:.5rem\">Prefer to paste an existing release? Drop it into the body field and our editor will handle the structure.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid mt-3\" style=\"gap:1.1rem\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"headline\">Headline <span class=\"hint\">— state the news, under 100 characters</span></label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"headline\" name=\"headline\" maxlength=\"120\" required placeholder=\"Acme Corp opens 40-person engineering office in Lisbon\">\n          <p class=\"hint\">Good: says what happened. Avoid: \"Acme is excited to announce a new chapter\".</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"dateline-city\">Dateline city</label>\n            <input class=\"input\" id=\"dateline-city\" name=\"datelineCity\" required placeholder=\"San Francisco\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"dateline-date\">Dateline date</label>\n            <input class=\"input\" id=\"dateline-date\" name=\"datelineDate\" type=\"date\" required>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"summary\">Subheading <span class=\"hint\">— one line of supporting detail</span></label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"summary\" name=\"summary\" maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"The office will hire 40 engineers by June 2027, the company said.\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"body\">Release body</label>\n          <textarea class=\"textarea\" id=\"body\" name=\"body\" required minlength=\"400\" placeholder=\"Open with who, what, when, where and why. Include at least one specific number, one quote from a named person, and an About section.\"></textarea>\n          <p class=\"hint\">Minimum 400 characters. Aim for 400–600 words. The editor checks substantiation on every claim.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"quote-name\">Quote attribution name</label>\n            <input class=\"input\" id=\"quote-name\" name=\"quoteName\" placeholder=\"Priya Raghunathan\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"quote-role\">Quote attribution role</label>\n            <input class=\"input\" id=\"quote-role\" name=\"quoteRole\" placeholder=\"Chief Executive Officer, Acme Corp\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"media\">Media assets <span class=\"hint\">— images, video, PDF media kit</span></label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"media\" name=\"media\" type=\"file\" multiple accept=\"image/*,video/*,application/pdf\">\n          <p class=\"hint\">You must hold the rights to everything you upload. Unlicensed imagery is the most common cause of rejection.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">3. Set targeting</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1);margin-top:.5rem\">Relevance beats volume. Choose the markets where the story is genuinely local.</p>\n      <div class=\"form-grid mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"countries\">Target countries</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"countries\" name=\"countries\" multiple size=\"4\">\n            <option selected>United States</option><option>Canada</option><option>United Kingdom</option><option>Germany</option><option>France</option><option>India</option><option>Australia</option><option>Singapore</option><option>United Arab Emirates</option><option>Brazil</option>\n          </select>\n          <p class=\"hint\">Hold Ctrl or Cmd to select more than one.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"language\">Additional languages</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"language\" name=\"language\" multiple size=\"4\">\n            <option>Arabic</option><option>Chinese (Simplified)</option><option>Dutch</option><option>French</option><option>German</option><option>Hebrew</option><option>Hindi</option><option>Italian</option><option>Japanese</option><option>Portuguese</option><option>Spanish</option>\n          </select>\n          <p class=\"hint\">$89 per language, native-speaker reviewed.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"embargo\">Embargo until <span class=\"hint\">— optional</span></label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"embargo\" name=\"embargo\" type=\"datetime-local\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"timezone\">Embargo timezone</label>\n          <select class=\"select\" id=\"timezone\" name=\"timezone\">\n            <option>UTC</option><option>America/New_York</option><option>America/Chicago</option><option>America/Los_Angeles</option><option>Europe/London</option><option>Europe/Berlin</option><option>Asia/Kolkata</option><option>Asia/Singapore</option><option>Australia/Sydney</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:var(--step-2)\">4. Contact and review</h2>\n      <div class=\"form-grid mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"contact-name\">Your name</label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"contact-name\" name=\"contactName\" required autocomplete=\"name\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"contact-email\">Work email</label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"contact-email\" name=\"contactEmail\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"organisation\">Organisation</label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"organisation\" name=\"organisation\" required autocomplete=\"organization\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"media-contact\">Media contact email <span class=\"hint\">— printed in the release</span></label>\n          <input class=\"input\" id=\"media-contact\" name=\"mediaContact\" type=\"email\" required>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid mt-3\" style=\"gap:.8rem\">\n        <label class=\"checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required><span>I confirm I have the rights to all submitted content and that the facts are accurate and verifiable.</span></label>\n        <label class=\"checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span>This release contains a paid placement or material relationship. <em>(Required disclosure — we will label it as such.)</em></span></label>\n        <label class=\"checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" required><span>I agree to the <a href=\"terms.html\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">terms of service</a> and <a href=\"privacy.html\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">privacy policy</a>.</span></label>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"between mt-4\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"mono faint\">Selected: <span class=\"gradient-text\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Amplify — $349</span></p>\n          <p class=\"mono faint\">Editorial review in 60 minutes</p>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" type=\"submit\">Submit for editorial review <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"form-status\" data-form-status aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">This build has no payment backend connected. Submissions are validated in the browser and confirmed on screen — connect an endpoint or your CRM before going live.</p>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Before you submit</p>\n      <h2>The four things that get a release approved faster</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-4\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>A number that matters</h3>\n  <p>One specific, verifiable figure in the first paragraph. It is what reporters quote.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>A sourced claim</h3>\n  <p>Superlatives need a citation. \"Highest-rated\" requires a source or it gets cut.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>A usable contact</h3>\n  <p>A monitored inbox, not a form. Journalists work to deadlines.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Rights-cleared assets</h3>\n  <p>Media must be yours to distribute, or it is rejected on sight.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"editorial-guidelines.html\">Read the full editorial guidelines <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"split\" style=\"align-items:start\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\" style=\"margin-bottom:0\" data-reveal>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Answers</p>\n        <h2>Submission questions</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The questions our editorial desk answers before every submission.</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 muted\" style=\"font-size:var(--step--1)\">Still stuck? <a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Talk to a specialist <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-list\" data-accordion=\"single\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">What is PressCosmos?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">PressCosmos is a press release distribution and AI visibility platform. You write or upload an announcement, our editors review it, and we syndicate it to newswire partners, trade media, regional press and AI answer engines while tracking every pickup, backlink and AI citation you earn.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How is PressCosmos different from a traditional newswire?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Traditional wires optimise for a press release existing on the internet. PressCosmos optimises for your announcement being found, quoted and repeated — by journalists, by search engines and by AI assistants. Every release ships with answer-engine formatting, structured data and entity markup by default.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">How long does it take to get published?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Median time from approved submission to first live pickup is 42 minutes on Amplify and Newsmaker plans. Launch plan releases go live within four business hours, and the crisis lane publishes in under 60 minutes at any hour.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Do you review press releases before publishing?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">Yes. Every release passes a human editorial review for accuracy, newsworthiness, disclosure requirements and formatting. We approve 98% of submissions, usually with suggested improvements rather than rejections.</div></div>\n        </div><div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\"><button class=\"faq-q\" type=\"button\">Can I distribute in multiple languages?<span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner prose\" style=\"font-size:var(--step-0)\">PressCosmos supports 24 languages including Arabic, Hebrew and Hindi in right-to-left and complex scripts. Translation is handled by specialist PR translators, not generic engines, and each language variant gets its own indexable page.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.95
}
